{
  "notes": "Ambient, E major, 66 BPM. A long ATMOS PAD in open fifths and ninths (no thirds: the ice), a granular cloud of vibraphone grains (VIBE HAZE) drifting up through each chord's third, seventh and ninth, the player's music box on the Smart Keys, and almost no percussion: a soft heartbeat, breathing shakers, a ride touched now and then. Every chord lasts two or four bars and the major pentatonic is consonant over all of them (I, IVmaj7, vi7, Vsus4), so any sparse note sounds placed. Scenes: A two chords of four bars; B Imaj7 vi7 IVmaj7 I(add9); C rises through IV V(sus4) vi to I; D the relative minor and IV, deep and still. Long transitions, gentle record quantise. All material is original.",
